{
  "slug": "phantom",
  "name": "Phantom",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI audio engineering system that turns Claude into a professional mix and mastering engineer. Point it at stems or a  full mix, give it a reference track you want to sound like, and it handles the rest: diagnostics, session setup, mixing, effects, and mastering in Reaper.\n\nBacked by real-time spectral, loudness, dynamics, stereo, and phase analysis via the Phantom MCP server.  5 domain expert skills work together as a complete audio production pipeline: analyze first, set up the DAW, mix with measurement-backed decisions, add creative effects, and master to streaming specs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `audio-diagnostician` (Pre-mix audio analysis and problem detection for audio engineering), `effects-engineer` (Deep expertise in audio effects for sound design and mixing), `mastering-engineer` (Professional mastering methodology for audio engineering), `mix-engineer` (Professional mixing methodology for audio engineering), `session-architect` (Session setup methodology for Reaper DAW)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install phantom@claude-community` from `fadelabs/phantom` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
